      "item": "proto_node_name",
      "reviewed": false,
      "intent": "Extract the declared name from a Protobuf item node: for message/enum/service/rpc return the text of the dedicated message_name/enum_name/service_name/rpc_name child; for field/enum_field/map_field/oneof/oneof_field return the text of the first identifier child (the declaration name, which follows the type node). Return None for any other node kind.",
