      "source_anchor": "fn proto_node_name(node: &Node, source: &str) -> Option<String> {"
    },
    {
      "item": "CONFIG",
      "reviewed": false,
      "intent": "Define the Protobuf language configuration for tree_path resolution: register the tree-sitter-proto grammar and .proto extension; map shorthands to node kinds (message, enum, service, rpc, field, map→map_field, oneof, oneof_field, enum_field); use the self-as-body (\".\") sentinel so item nodes act as their own body container; mark message_body and enum_body transparent so the resolver descends into nested members; supply proto_node_name for name extraction and proto_has_doc_comment for doc-comment detection.",
